    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Churches Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market a triple aspect apartment in a fantastic location. \r\n\r\nThis spacious two-bedroom home is positioned on the bright, south-facing side of the building with triple-aspect views, the property benefits from a great sense of space and natural light.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, a spacious living area with views of greenery, a separate fitted kitchen with ample storage and counter space, two well-proportioned double bedrooms and a tiled shower room with separate tiled W.C room both windowed. Outside, the development features communal landscaped grounds surrounded by mature trees, planting and parking area. \r\n\r\nLocation is superb with numerous shopping areas on your door step offering a selection of local convenient stores, large grocery stores, local LIDL/ALDI, cafes and pubs that will cater for all your needs as well as Dun Laoghaire, Dalkey and Glenageary and all their associated amenities.\r\n\r\nThe area also has numerous transport links including walking distance to Glenageary DART station, easy access to the M50/N11 road networks and Aircoach providing swift and direct access to the airport as well as numerous Dublin Bus routes all close at hand."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall:                                                                                                                                                              c.        8.6 x 1.4m\r\n\r\nLiving Room:                                                                                                                                                 c.       5.4 x 3.2m\r\n\r\nW.C:                                                                                                                                                              c.       1.3 x 1.9m\r\n\r\nKitchen:                                                                                                                                                         c.       3.1 x 2m\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:                                                                                                                                                   c.\t3.4 x 3.1m          (to front)\r\n  \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:                                                                                                                                                    c.\t3.1 x 3.2m\t    (to rear)\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom:                                                                                                                                                       c.       3.1 x 1.7m"
      },
